          <declname>SU</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>AdjustPriorityOfUnscheduledPreds - One of the predecessors of SU was just scheduled. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>If SU is not itself available, then there is at least one predecessor node that has not been scheduled yet. If SU has exactly ONE unscheduled predecessor, we want to increase its priority: it getting scheduled will make this node available, so it is better than some other node of the same priority that will not make a node available. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
